<title>USA: Harding Lawson authorizes stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Harding Lawson authorizes stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NOVATO, Calif. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harding Lawson Associates Group Inc said its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of its common stock from time to time through the open market. It said the decision to buy back shares would be based on market conditions.</p>
<p>The company currently has 4,982,327 shares outstanding.</p>
